Feature:

Background: This executes once per feature file
	Given these properties
		|portal.fixpack.release|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Patching Tool|
	And these variables
		|portal.fixpack.release|true|
		|testray.main.component.name|Patching Tool|
		|testBuildFixPackZipURL|TestPropsUtil#get('test.build.fix.pack.zip.url')|
		|testBuildFixPackZipURLPrevious|TestPropsUtil#get('test.build.fix.pack.zip.url.previous')|
Setup: This executes before each scenario 
	Given SignIn sign In Test Setup
Scenario: Revert Fix Pack
Description: Ensures that a fix pack can be reverted.
Priority: 5
	Given these properties
		|skip.install-patch|true|
	When these properties
		|test.assert.warning.exceptions|true|
	And SignOut sign Out
	And Portlet shutdown Server
	And PatchingTool install Patch
		|patchFileZipURL|${testBuildFixPackZipURL}|
	And Portlet start Server
		|deleteLiferayHome|false|
	And SignIn sign In
	And SignOut sign Out
	And Portlet shutdown Server
	And PatchingTool uninstall Patches
	And PatchingTool install Patch
		|patchFileZipURL|${testBuildFixPackZipURLPrevious}|
	And Portlet start Server
		|deleteLiferayHome|false|
	Then SignIn sign In

